I can't give a figure for this. JPMorgan doesn't report a standalone fourth-quarter cash flow statement. Its 10-Qs show year-to-date cash flows, and the 10-K shows the full year. Q4 2025 operating cash flow would therefore be the full-year 2025 figure minus the nine-month figure.

I don't have reliable values for those two 2025 totals. JPMorgan's operating cash flow also swings by tens of billions of dollars from period to period with trading assets, loans held for sale and deposit-related movements, so an estimate would not be meaningful.

